{"title":"Open Mic: Part XIX","startsAt":"2026-10-07T18:45:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-07T21:45:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Hello Fellow Writers - Get ready for our first event of the fall!\n\n**Toronto Writers Community** is having an Open Mic event on October 7 @ the **Tranzac Club** (**292 Brunswick Ave**).\n\nThis is our 19th Open Mic. Our Open Mic events can legally drink now. But all dad jokes aside, it's hard to believe we've made it this far. The momentum feels like we're only getting started.\n\nPlease let me know either here on Meetup or through [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/torontowriterscommunity/) or the night of, if you would like to present. We can't wait to see you!\n\nBring a friend (or many) and get ready for a night of sharing work and taking in the talent that Toronto has to offer. Feel free to read or to come and listen. Meet new people, get inspired.\n\n**416**\n\n6:45pm, ends at 9:30pm\nWednesday, **October 7, 2026**.\nTRANZAC CLUB - 292 Brunswick Ave\n\nHope to see you there!\n\nAs always, the event is free, but a donation bowl will be present.\nAn extra thanks to our sponsor, the [Alexandra Writers Centre Society](https://www.alexandrawriters.org/). They make these Open Mics in Toronto possible.\n\nSTAY CREATIVE.","venue":{"name":"The Tranzac Club","address":"292 Brunswick Avenue, Toronto","lat":43.665234,"lng":-79.407555,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Writers Community","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/c/b/c/highres_533512412.jpeg"}